  "claim": "Target121 u22170 and u22174 form one compiler-extracted configured-worker manager/runDaemon cluster owned by src/daemon/main.ts::runDaemon, not src/main.tsx. Target120 u19500 contains the same worker configuration, authentication, watcher, reload, and shutdown lifecycle inline in its complete runDaemon. Target121 extracts that lifecycle into u22170 and u22174 calls its returned workerCount, hasOAuthConsumer, disposeWatcher, drainReloads, and stop interface. The exact raw and postPrune source states contain the complete integrated lifecycle byte-identically inside runDaemon; their only file-level difference is the separately authenticated daemon-status writer replay. The six build literals are two VERSION/BUILD_TIME/GIT_SHA substitutions and are segregated from the twelve worker-manager strict rows. Source replay is neither necessary nor authorized.",
